  "engineered_feature_policy": {
    "season": "not created - redundant with the month one-hot block",
    "weekend": "not created - the Phase 0 admission condition (a weekday/weekend PM2.5 difference established by the pre-modelling EDA) was not met, because Phase 3 did not perform that comparison",
    "cyclical_sin_cos": "not created - month and hour are represented categorically, which lets a linear model fit non-monotone structure without imposing a sinusoidal shape",
